{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00873","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高 · 僧齐己","name":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山高，巫女妖。\n雨爲暮兮云爲朝，楚王顦顇魂欲销。\n秋猨嗥嗥日将夕，红霞紫烟凝老壁。\n千岩万壑花皆坼，但恐芳菲无正色。\n不知今古行人行，几人经此无秋情。\n云深庙远不可觅，十二峰头插天碧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}